    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380340/extras/86ab85fb5eae9f9afc9938a4c3ac1e17.avif?t=1752761397\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 &quot;Dragon Road &quot;is an open world 3D game. and a mission centered survival and combat game. that includes gameplay such as role-playing, tactical strategy, player cooperation, mission monster fighting, and experience leveling. In the plot, Wang Yangming's philosophy of the mind is combined, and he learns Wang Yangming's sage thoughts while playing the game. The philosophy of the mind is also known as the Dragon Way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 The game has developed dozens of scenes and combat tasks, allowing players to complete the task step by step, get certain gold coins, experience and prestige rewards, and present certain precious weapons and mounts. While learning the survival instincts of fishing and fire, hunting and skinning, riding a horse and driving a boat, and using magic, the players also gradually improved the martial arts level and offensive and defensive abilities of the heroes in the Wulin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380340/extras/b5c202a2f1dbda7fd01c90458c5efb67.avif?t=1752761397\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 The game also features four player avatars, and players can choose the corresponding avatar according to their preferences when starting the game. The four characters include two female generals and two grand marshals, each of which is lifelike and unique, and is worth players to try out one by one. The game also supports multiplayer collaboration to fight monsters. Currently, it supports up to four people in online games, with one person as the main player and others as auxiliary players, allowing for teamwork and joint completion of combat tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The background and plot of the story are as follows:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 Billions of years ago, there was a huge dragon tribe on Earth that originated in the Himalayas and lived in nearby areas. The mountains were high and lush, with abundant food chains and activity areas with significant altitude differences, which led to the early evolution of this dragon tribe. People called them &quot;humanoid dragons&quot;. As humanoid dragons continued to migrate to the Qinghai Tibet Plateau, the Central Plains, and the Hangzhou Jiaxing Huzhou Plain, their bodies slowly stood up and eventually evolved into the first humans: Dragon Cloud and Dragon Cloud.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380340/extras/0e43b779f0fdbcaae2010c5fd016bdb5.avif?t=1752761397\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 In order to survive, Long Yun and Long Yun, as well as their descendants, gradually learned survival skills such as logging and fruit picking, medicinal and mining, hunting and fishing, and riding horses and boats. In order to survive better, humans constantly cut grass and wood to build grass houses and wooden fences, mine and iron to make agricultural tools and weapons. The residence has also been built from open-air group houses, with each unit consisting of rough grass houses to prevent wind and rain. I also learned how to make fire and roast animal meat from hunting and eating raw meat. Some tribes(such as Hemudu, Tianluoshan, etc.) even used ropes to tie knots and count, planted rice water chestnuts, and produced planters, blacksmiths, pharmacists, and shamans for worship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 The general trend of the world is that if it is divided for a long time, it will merge, and if it is merged for a long time, it will divide. As the saying goes, 'When things are extreme, they will reverse; when they are prosperous, they will decline.' This is the ultimate principle of heaven and earth, even if they are as powerful as the Tang Dynasty. In the Middle Ages, after the collapse of the Tang Dynasty, it ushered in the most chaotic and shortest period of &quot;Five Dynasties and Ten Kingdoms&quot; in history. The country was plagued by war and chaos, and the people were struggling. After years of mutual warfare and annexation, there were still eight political regimes left: Later Jin, Later Shu, Nanping, Later Chu, Southern Tang, Wu Yue, Dali, and Southern Han.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380340/extras/c9609ed3a65349c5c9bb044ed33f7049.avif?t=1752761397\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 Human beings were born to fight. In the Later Jin Dynasty, the cursed king had a vast territory and strong power, supported by the demonic forces led by the Eastern and Northern demonic sects, competing for power and fighting against the soldiers of the Kingdom of Pele. He defeated the soldiers of the Kingdom of Pele, imprisoned the Queen of Pele, and abducted the Little Prince Lett. The great hero Long Yun (Yun), who has traveled through the world, is the embodiment of the true dragon emperor Zhao Kuangyin. With the power of the &quot;Five Emperors Dragon Fist&quot; and a coiled dragon stick, he travels throughout China, constantly conquering cities and territories to uphold justice and cleanse evil, demonstrating his heroic qualities and completing one mission after another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 I don't know who opened Pandora's Box and alarmed the demon race. The demon race, which had been sealed for thousands of years, smelled the fresh scent of human blood. For a moment, a demonic wind swept through the world, and various underworld ghosts, monsters, zombies, wooden corpses, ancient undead or ghosts appeared one after another. Especially at midnight, they hunted and killed humans in various dark mountains and forests, drank blood and breathed in. So, humans embarked on a game of killing and being killed with demons for thousands of years.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 Finally, on Earth, another massive dragon clan suddenly appeared in the sand dune area deep in the forest. This dragon tribe originated from the Jurassic dinosaur tribe in the vast ocean hundreds of millions of years ago, evolving from the depths of the ocean to shallow seas and coasts. They narrowly escaped the mass extinction caused by forest fires on Earth and have recently crossed the Great Wall to the Central Plains to fight against humans in order to survive. In order to take control of the universe and dominate the Central Plains, humans have organized themselves and elected you as their leader, thus engaging in a prolonged territorial struggle with this dinosaur tribe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380340/extras/42a12a321b68a6922011fee961f7867e.avif?t=1752761397\" data-has-big width=800 height=478 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 What is the fate of humanity? What kind of changes will it bring to this world? Everything needs to be conquered to the fullest by the hero. Please embark on a new journey!</p>",
